C MASTERY ARENA — PREMIUM C PROGRAMMING TEST SIMULATOR

Open C_Mastering_Arena.html in Chrome/Edge/Firefox.

Modes:
• Quick Test — 20 questions / 15 min
• Full Mock — 50 questions / 45 min
• Marathon — 100 questions / 90 min
• Contest Arena — 30 questions / 30 min, +10 correct / -2 wrong
• Chapter Drill — targeted practice for Chapters 1–11
• Weakness Hunter — targets your lowest saved chapter accuracy
• Code Output — mixed code-reading practice
• Surprise Challenge — randomized challenge

Features:
• Randomized question order
• Question palette for jumping
• Timer and auto-submit
• Keyboard shortcuts 1–4 and arrow keys
• Instant score and grade
• Chapter-wise performance
• Full answer review with explanations
• Local progress/best score tracking
• Works offline; no account or internet required

The question bank is based on the uploaded C Tutorial Notes folder, covering Chapters 1–11 and the concepts represented in the homework material.
